            "text": "theorem norm_mainPart_le {α x δ M D : ℝ} {a k : ℤ} {q : ℕ} (hx : 0 < x) (hq : 1 ≤ q)\n    (h2α : 2 * α = a / q + δ / x + k) (hM0 : 0 ≤ M) (hMδ : |δ| * M ≤ x / 2) (hMD : M ≤ D) :\n    ‖mainPart α x M q‖ ≤\n      x / (2 * q) * minInv c₀ (π * δ) * |muSum M q (2 * q) fun _ => 1| +\n        c₀ * q / x * (1 / 8 - 1 / (2 * π ^ 2)) * (D / q + 1) ^ 2 := by",
